        "contentType": "opinion",
        "category": "opinion",
        "annotation": "While Aider offers immediate utility for AI-assisted coding, its long-term viability depends on *maintainability* and *integration depth*. Tools like GitHub Actions [1] and multistep pipelines [0] might offer more sustainable automation solutions.",
